{
  "dom_id": "step-e12958",
  "name": "Example: Solving a One-Step Inequality With Fractions When Flipping Is Required",
  "problem": "Solve the inequality $-\\dfrac{y}{8} \\leq -4.$",
  "worked_solution": "The variable $y$ is being *divided* by $8.$ To isolate $y$ and remove the negative sign, we *multiply* by $-8.$ \n\nRemember, when multiplying or dividing an inequality by a negative number, we need to flip the inequality sign:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{y}{8}\\,\\, & \\le \\,\\,-4 \\\\ (-8)\\cdot (-\\frac{y}{8})\\,\\, & \\ge \\,\\,(-8)\\cdot (-4) \\\\ (-8)\\cdot (-\\frac{y}{8})\\,\\, & \\ge \\,\\,32\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince two negative numbers multiply to give a positive number, we first cancel the negatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-8)\\cdot (-\\frac{y}{8}) & \\ge 32 \\\\ (\\cancel{-}8)\\cdot (\\cancel{-}\\frac{y}{8}) & \\ge 32 \\\\ 8\\cdot \\frac{y}{8} & \\ge 32\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can cancel a common factor of $8$ from both the numerator and denominator.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}8\\cdot \\frac{y}{8} & \\ge 32 \\\\ \\frac{8y}{8} & \\ge 32 \\\\ \\frac{\\cancel{8}y}{\\cancel{8}} & \\ge 32 \\\\ y & \\ge 32\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $y \\geq 32.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e12958\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Solving a One-Step Inequality With Fractions When Flipping Is Required</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e12958\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpa